 and leaving pause during video playback.Fixes & ImprovementsFixed the incorrectly written \"secutir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T00:48:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217015","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3681450-1840944183781310","game_id":"steam-3681450","kind":"update","title":"DUMMY HOUSE Demo Update — Version 0.11.1","summary":"What's newImproved Initial TutorialReworked parts of the introductory tutorial.Improved the order and presentation of instructions.Important actions are now easier to identify.Reduced situations where players could become unsure about what to interact with next.Improved tutorial UI feedback and visual guidance.Pause Menu RedesignThe pause screen has been completely reworked.Improved overall layout and readability.Better visual consistency with the rest of the game's interface.Improved navigation","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T03:37:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781310","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3681450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3681450":"2026-10-26T00:44:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3681450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4747790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
